        "status": "active",
        "job": "Derive the current tools of one native-selected source without opening account records",
        "description": "An installed inner source resolver. Native source admission supplies current configuration, original definitions, exact cache snapshots and authenticated MCP list results as task DATA and retains their real root/currentness witness through effects and output. Only need and wait are input. Native-only planning derives exact current cache ids and needed authenticated source reads through this same owner. The derivation opens no records descriptor, enlarges no caller record rights and writes no durable cache. Credentials remain with the native connection owner.",
